+# Version Scheme
+
+This project's version numbering scheme is Semantic Versioning (semver). This value was recorded in `config/decisions/revoke-version-scheme.json`, which was later relocated out of the tree in the "move decision config out of the tree" commit; that relocation did not change or retire the recorded value, so semver remains the current decision.
